<!-- Privacy Policy Modal -->
<div id="privacy-modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-[100] hidden items-center justify-center p-4">
	<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-sm transition-opacity" onclick="document.getElementById('privacy-modal').classList.add('hidden')"></div>
	<div class="relative bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl w-full max-w-3xl max-h-[85vh] overflow-y-auto shadow-2xl z-10 flex flex-col">
		<div class="sticky top-0 bg-zinc-900/95 backdrop-blur border-b border-zinc-800 p-6 flex justify-between items-center">
			<h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-white">Privacy Policy</h2>
			<button onclick="document.getElementById('privacy-modal').classList.add('hidden')" class="text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">
				<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg>
			</button>
		</div>
		<div class="p-6 md:p-8 space-y-6 text-zinc-300 font-light text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
			<p class="font-bold text-white">Go Marketing y Eventos SAS — GO Agency<br>Last updated: 2026</p>

			<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-2">Who we are</h3>
			<p>GO Agency is the commercial brand of Go Marketing y Eventos SAS, a company incorporated in Colombia. We provide strategic consulting, brand, digital products and communications services.<br>
			Website: goestrategiacreativa.com<br>
			Contact: <a href="mailto:hello@goestrategiacreativa.com" class="text-[#45ccaa] hover:underline">hello@goestrategiacreativa.com</a></p>

			<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-2">What data we collect</h3>
			<p>When you use our contact form or interact with our website, we may collect:</p>
			<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-zinc-400">
				<li>Full name</li>
				<li>Email address</li>
				<li>Phone number (if provided)</li>
				<li>Message content</li>
				<li>Browsing data via cookies (pages visited, time on site)</li>
			</ul>

			<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-2">Why we collect it</h3>
			<p>We use your data exclusively to:</p>
			<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-zinc-400">
				<li>Respond to your business inquiry</li>
				<li>Send relevant information about our services if you have requested it</li>
				<li>Improve the performance and experience of our website</li>
			</ul>
			<p class="mt-4 font-medium text-white">We do not sell, rent or share your personal data with third parties for commercial purposes.</p>

			<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-2">Legal basis</h3>
			<p>Data collection and processing is governed by Ley 1581 de 2012 (Colombian Personal Data Protection Law) and its regulatory decrees. By submitting our contact form, you consent to the processing of your data for the purposes described above.</p>

			<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-2">Data retention</h3>
			<p>We retain your data for as long as necessary to fulfill the purpose for which it was collected, or as required by Colombian law. You may request deletion at any time.</p>

			<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-2">Your rights</h3>
			<p>Under Colombian law, you have the right to:</p>
			<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-zinc-400">
				<li>Know, update and rectify your personal data</li>
				<li>Request deletion of your data</li>
				<li>Revoke your consent at any time</li>
				<li>File a complaint with the Superintendencia de Industria y Comercio (SIC)</li>
			</ul>
			<p class="mt-4">To exercise any of these rights, contact us at:<br>
			<a href="mailto:hello@goestrategiacreativa.com" class="text-[#45ccaa] hover:underline">hello@goestrategiacreativa.com</a></p>

			<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-2">Cookies</h3>
			<p>Our website uses cookies to analyze traffic and improve user experience. You may accept or decline non-essential cookies when you first visit the site. Declining cookies will not affect your ability to use the website.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>

